Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,The microwave oven was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.41,0:00:03.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,invented by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:03.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:04.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,to a melted candy bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nineteen forty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,Percy Spencer was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:10.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,a top engineer at Raytheon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:11.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,a company building radar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,for the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:13.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,for a guy who dropped out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:15.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,of grammar school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:16.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,One day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,he stood next
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:18.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,to a magnetron,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:18.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,the tube
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:20.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,that powers radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the candy bar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,in his pocket turned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:23.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,into goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:24.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most people would just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:25.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,be mad about losing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:26.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:28.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Percy got curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:29.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,He held a bag
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:30.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,of popcorn kernels up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:31.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,to the tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:32.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,They popped all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,over the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,Legend says he tried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:36.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,an egg next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:38.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,It exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,So Raytheon built
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:41.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,the first microwave oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:42.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,It was six feet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:43.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,tall and weighed about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:44.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,seven hundred and fifty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:45.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:46.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:46.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,there's one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:48.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,in almost every kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,And Percy's reward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,for inventing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:52.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,A two-dollar bonus.
